{"id":"4f429cabb0431a2d","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-cor-baire.md","title":"Baire Category Corollary","display":"cor-baire — Baire Category Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-baire","aliases":["58-cor-baire"],"display":"cor-baire — Baire Category Corollary","depends_on":["[[58-df-metric]]","[[58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-baire"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-baire</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-baire — Baire Category Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c2c52f227661657\" href=\"?note=2c2c52f227661657\" title=\"58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space\">58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d,A\\in V\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(X,d,A\\in V\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_d(x,\\varepsilon)=\\{y\\in X\\mid d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(B_d(x,\\varepsilon)=\\{y\\in X\\mid d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2c2c52f227661657\" href=\"?note=2c2c52f227661657\" title=\"58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space\">58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}baire} \\vdash \\left[\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists y\\in X\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\left(B_d(y,\\delta)\\subseteq B_d(x,\\varepsilon)\\land B_d(y,\\delta)\\cap A(n)=\\emptyset\\right)\\right]\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\notin A(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}baire} \\vdash \\left[\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists y\\in X\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\left(B_d(y,\\delta)\\subseteq B_d(x,\\varepsilon)\\land B_d(y,\\delta)\\cap A(n)=\\emptyset\\right)\\right]\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\notin A(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the nonempty complete-metric-space form of the Baire category theorem.</li>\n<li>The ball condition explicitly says that each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(n)\">\\(A(n)\\)</span> is nowhere dense.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space","status":"resolved","id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-metric]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space","status":"resolved","id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d,A\\in V\\land X\\neq\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B_d(x,\\varepsilon)=\\{y\\in X\\mid d(x,y)<\\varepsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}baire} \\vdash \\left[\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists y\\in X\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\left(B_d(y,\\delta)\\subseteq B_d(x,\\varepsilon)\\land B_d(y,\\delta)\\cap A(n)=\\emptyset\\right)\\right]\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\notin A(n))","display":true},{"tex":"A(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1315,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-cor-baire.md|58-cor-baire]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["267957a097ff75bf","2c2c52f227661657","36d7463d215be751"]}